title: crownQuest_Dialogue
---
This is an example of a Yarn Spinner script. Write your dialogue here!
===
title: loadPhase
---
<<declare $dialoguePhase = "">>
<<declare $hasVisited = false>>
<<setPhase kingNPC>>
///npc gameOb name called in the setPhase command dshould map to the specific npc you want to reference
///
<<if $dialoguePhase == "begin">>
<<jump Start>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase == "comeback">>
<<jump comeback>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase == "quest_started">>
<<jump questStart>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase == "quest_completed">>
<<jump questComplete>>
<<else>>
King: Heresy!
<<endif>>
===

title: Start
---
<<set $hasVisited to true>>
King: You must be the peasant my guard sent.
King: Are you even qualified to be doing this?
-> Probably not
    King: Well, we'll just manage.
    King: I am the King, and you must do something for me.
    ->Sure.
        <<getPhase kingNPC "quest_started">>
        King: Excellent
-> Of course I am
    <<getPhase kingNPC "quest_started">>
    King: Sure you are...anyways.
-> OK, rude much?
    <<getPhase kingNPC "quest_started">>
    King: Who cares? I'm your king, I can be as rude as I want.
===

title: comeback
---
King: Well look who decided to show their face again.
-> Relax, I'll help you out.
    King: Hmph, thats what I thought.
    King: Run along then.
===

title: questStart
---
King: You see, it seems as though I have lost a crown.
King: I would like you to find it for me.
-> Ok, sounds easy enough.
    King: Excellent. Now, go on.
    King: Don't keep a king waiting.
-> And if I don't?
    <<getPhase kingNPC "comeback">>
    King: Then you are useless to me. 
    King: Shoo.
-> What if I pawn it off instead?
    King: Death viia a beheading.
    King: Anyways good luck.

===

title: questComplete
---
<<if $hasVisited == true>>
King: Have you found it?
-> Yes sir
    King: Oh how delightful!
    King: Now my dearest son may have his crown back!
    -> Your son?
        King: Why yes, who did you think was beside me this whole time?
        The King's Finest: -squeak-
<<else>>
King: You there, how dare you enter my home without preamble!
-> Sorry, but I found this tiny crown thingy; Is it yours?
    King: Get ou-
    King: Oh wait, it is actually.
    King: My son's crown!
    King: I have no clue who in the devil you are but thank you anyways.
    King: My son can be happy once more.
    The King's Finest: -squeak!-
<<endif>>
===

